OL,3,GNEWSATaxis set to keep access through
OL,4,ABank Junction
OL,5,
OL,6,FBlack cabs are set to keep weekday
OL,7,Faccess through Bank Junction after a
OL,8,Ftest reopening found mixed results on
OL,9,Fsafety, public transport and
OL,10,Faccessibility.
OL,12,FThe junction was largely closed to
OL,13,Ftraffic in 2017 on weekdays between
OL,14,F07:00 and 19:00 after a cyclist died
OL,15,Fthere and more than 100 people were
OL,16,Finjured.
OL,18,FCity of London Corporation members
OL,19,Fvoted to try lifting some restrictions,
OL,20,Fand allowed taxis to travel between
OL,21,FPoultry and Cornhill from July 2025.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,325,320,200,140,0,100
